  "details": "It would be really nice for us to be able to spawn a secondary mirror. Personally to me it doesn't matter if the settings aren't individually adjustable.\nBut it would be nice to be able to place two mirrors, Since you can move them around it would be easy to place them around however you want/need them. front and back would be really helpful for dance performances etc.\nAlso currently the mirror currently does not save position after disabling.\nIf both these features could be implemented it would make the current system near perfect.",
